/-!
# Differential Test Vectors for `GF16`

Deterministic `spqr-vectors` suite for `GF(2^16)` arithmetic (`add`, `poly_mul`, `mul`, `div`),
`REDUCE_BYTES`, and `parallel_mult`.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace CryptoVerification.SpqrV1.Vectors.GF16

/-- One GF(2^16) differential test vector (`src/encoding/gf.rs`). -/
structure GF16Entry where
  a : BitVec 16
